From 653566e907dd3c32c4a42d8b536fcab563acfa53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
Date: Mon, 10 Nov 2025 12:28:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 150/211] wip! ASoC: codecs: add support for TFA98xx based on
 downstream

Temporary solution, until proper driver gets into mainline!

Need firmware (the one from j0sh1x works just fine).

Imported from: https://github.com/j0sh1x/tfa98xx and heavily modified.
Discussion w/ Goodix about upstreaming: https://github.com/Goodix-vas/tfa98xx/issues/1

Signed-off-by: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
